helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	$[officename] Calc Features				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154758				0	lv	\<variable id=\"main0503\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Calc Features\"\>$[officename] Calc Features\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	lv	$[officename] Calc is a spreadsheet application that you can use to calculate, analyze, and manage your data. You can also import and modify Microsoft Excel spreadsheets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148797				0	lv	Calculations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145172				0	lv	$[officename] Calc provides you with \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060100.xhp\" name=\"functions\"\>functions\</link\>, including statistical and banking functions, that you can use to create formulas to perform complex calculations on your data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	lv	You can also use the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"AutoPilots\"\>Function Wizard\</link\> to help you create your formulas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	lv	What-If Calculations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	lv	An interesting feature is to be able to immediately view the results of changes made to one factor of calculations that are composed of several factors. For instance, you can see how changing the time period in a loan calculation affects the interest rates or repayment amounts. Furthermore, you can manage larger tables by using different predefined scenarios.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	lv	Database Functions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	lv	Use spreadsheets to arrange, store, and filter your data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	lv	$[officename] Calc lets you drag-and-drop tables from databases, or lets you use a spreadsheet as a data source for creating form letters in $[officename] Writer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145800				0	lv	Arranging Data				20200411 15:09:53
