helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10060000.xhp\"\>Rectangle\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E1				0	lv	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EE				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10070000.xhp\"\>Ellipse\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FE				0	lv	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN1060B				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10050000.xhp\"\>Text\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061B				0	lv	Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				20200411 15:09:53
