helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433835				0	lv	The Formatting Bar is shown when a chart is set to edit mode. Double-click a chart to enter edit mode. Click outside the chart to leave edit mode.				20200411 15:09:53
