helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200902300834				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Moves all chart elements to their default positions inside the current chart. This function does not alter the chart type or any other attributes other than the position of elements.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
