helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145481				0	lv	This section provides an overview of the toolbars available in $[officename] Writer. \<embedvar href=\"text/shared/00/00000007.xhp#symbolleistenneu\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Status Bar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153397				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0208.xhp\" name=\"Status Bar\"\>Status Bar\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414	2			0	lv	The Status Bar contains information about the current document and offers various buttons with special functions. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id9648731				0	lv	Language				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the language for the selected text. \<br/\>Click to open a menu where you can choose another language for the selected text or for the current paragraph. \<br/\>Choose None to exclude the text from spellchecking and hyphenation. \<br/\>Choose Reset to Default Language to re-apply the default language for the selection or the paragraph. \<br/\>Choose More to open a dialog with more options.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id0821200911015962				0	lv	Digital Signature				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id0821200911015941				0	lv	See also \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/digital_signatures.xhp\"\>Digital Signatures\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id8070314				0	lv	Zoom & View Layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id7723929				0	lv	Three controls on the Writer Status Bar allow to change the zoom and view layout of your text documents. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3666188				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The View Layout icons show from left to right: Single column mode. View mode with pages side by side. Book mode with two pages as in an open book.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8796349				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Drag the Zoom slider to the left to show more pages, drag to the right to zoom into a page and show a smaller area of the page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	$[officename] Writer Features				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154243				0	lv	\<variable id=\"main0503\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Writer Features\"\>$[officename] Writer Features\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154263				0	lv	$[officename] Writer lets you design and produce text documents that can include graphics, tables, or charts. You can then save the documents in a variety of formats, including the standardized OpenDocument format (ODF), Microsoft Word .doc format, or HTML. And you can easily export your document to the Portable Document Format (PDF).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147755				0	lv	Writing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147768				0	lv	$[officename] Writer lets you create both basic documents, such as memos, \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/fax.xhp\" name=\"faxes\"\>faxes\</link\>, letters, resumes and \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01150000.xhp\" name=\"merge documents\"\>merge documents\</link\>, as well as long and complex or multi-part documents, complete with bibliographies, reference tables and indexes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147797				0	lv	$[officename] Writer also includes such useful features as a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010000.xhp\" name=\"spellchecker\"\>spellchecker\</link\>, a \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_thesaurus.xhp\" name=\"thesaurus\"\>thesaurus\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040000.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect\"\>AutoCorrect\</link\>, and \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06030000.xhp\" name=\"Hyphenation\"\>hyphenation\</link\> as well as a variety of \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010100.xhp\" name=\"templates\"\>templates\</link\> for almost every purpose. You can also create your own templates using the wizards.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147225				0	lv	Designing and Structuring				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147239				0	lv	$[officename] offers a wide variety of options to design documents. Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles\"\>Styles and Formatting window\</link\> to create, assign and modify styles for paragraphs, individual characters, frames and pages. In addition, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\> helps you to quickly move around inside your documents, lets you look at your document in an outline view, and keeps track of the objects that you have inserted into your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147272				0	lv	You can also create various \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120000.xhp\" name=\"indexes and tables\"\>indexes and tables\</link\> in text documents. You can define the structure and appearance of the indexes and tables according to your individual needs. Live hyperlinks and bookmarks let you jump directly to the corresponding items in the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145596				0	lv	Desktop Publishing with $[officename] Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610				0	lv	$[officename] Writer contains numerous desktop publishing and drawing tools to assist you in creating professionally styled documents, such as brochures, newsletters and invitations. You can format your documents with multi-column layouts, \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_frame.xhp\" name=\"text frames\"\>text frames\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic.xhp\" name=\"graphics\"\>graphics\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"tables\"\>tables\</link\>, and other objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145649				0	lv	Calculations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145663				0	lv	Text documents in $[officename] have an integrated \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0214.xhp\" name=\"calculation function\"\>calculation function\</link\> that helps you execute sophisticated calculations or logical links. You can easily create a table in a text document in order to perform calculations.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151192				0	lv	Creating Drawings				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151206				0	lv	The $[officename] Writer \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"drawing tool\"\>drawing tool\</link\> lets you create drawings, graphics, legends, and other types of drawings directly in text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151229				0	lv	Inserting Graphics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151243				0	lv	You can insert pictures with \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"different formats\"\>different formats\</link\> into a text document, including graphics with a JPG or GIF format. In addition, the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/gallery.xhp\" name=\"Gallery\"\>Gallery\</link\> provides a collection of clipart graphics, and the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/fontwork.xhp\"\>Fontwork Gallery\</link\> creates stunning font effects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155084				0	lv	Flexible Application Interface				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098				0	lv	The program interface is designed so that you can configure it according to your preferences, including customizing icons and menus. You can position various program windows, such as the Styles and Formatting window or the Navigator as floating windows anywhere on the screen. You can also \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/autohide.xhp\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> some windows to the edge of the workspace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155123				0	lv	Drag&Drop				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3155137				0	lv	The \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/dragdrop.xhp\" name=\"drag-and-drop\"\>drag-and-drop\</link\> feature enables you to work quickly and efficiently with text documents in $[officename]. For example, you can drag-and-drop objects, such as graphics from the Gallery, from one location to another in the same document, or between open $[officename] documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155162				0	lv	Help Functions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145675				0	lv	You can use the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help system\"\>Help system\</link\> as a complete reference for $[officename] applications, including \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"instructions\"\>instructions\</link\> for simple and complex tasks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Rulers				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154201				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Rulers\"\>Rulers\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218				0	lv	Rulers display the dimensions of the page, and the position of tabs, indents, borders and columns. You can modify all of these on the rulers using the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154239				0	lv	By double-clicking on the ruler, you can open the \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> dialog and assign \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"direct paragraph formatting\"\>direct paragraph formatting\</link\> for the current paragraph or all selected paragraphs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Page Preview				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145783				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0210.xhp\" name=\"Page Preview\"\>Page Preview\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154253				0	lv	The \<emph\>Page Preview\</emph\> Bar appears when you view the current document in the page preview mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	File				20200411 15:09:53
