helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150749				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0202.xhp\" name=\"Status Bar\"\>Status Bar\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id3083278				0	lv	The status bar displays information about the active document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0203.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Tools Bar				20200411 15:09:53
