helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060600.xhp\" name=\"Xor-Operator [Runtime]\"\>Xor-Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	lv	Performs a logical Exclusive-Or combination of two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
