helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153968				0	lv	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	lv	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numeric variable that contains the result of the combination.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	lv	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any numeric expressions that you want to combine.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	lv	A logical Exclusive-Or conjunction of two Boolean expressions returns the value True only if both expressions are different from each other.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770				0	lv	A bitwise Exclusive-Or conjunction returns a bit if the corresponding bit is set in only one of the two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
