helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020406.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	lv	\<emph\>TextFrom:\</emph\> Any string expression that specifies the name of the file that you want to copy. The expression can contain optional path and drive information. If you want, you can enter a path in \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020406.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	lv	\<emph\>TextTo:\</emph\> Any string expression that specifies where you want to copy the source file to. The expression can contain the destination drive, the path, and file name, or the path in URL notation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020406.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	lv	You can only use the FileCopy statement to copy files that are not opened.				20200411 15:09:53
