helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150986				0	lv	Converts any string or numeric expression to a date value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148944				0	lv	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
