helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	lv	Sin (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156214				0	lv	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
