helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143268				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>Mid function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Mid statement\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120306.xhp\" name=\"Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]\"\>Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	lv	Returns the specified portion of a string expression (\<emph\>Mid function\</emph\>), or replaces the portion of a string expression with another string (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154285				0	lv	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	lv	Mid (Text As String, Start As Long [, Length As Long]) or Mid (Text As String, Start As Long , Length As Long, Text As String)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	lv	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	lv	String (only by Function)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154347				0	lv	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	lv	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that you want to modify.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359	9			0	lv	\<emph\>Start: \</emph\>Numeric expression that indicates the character position within the string where the string portion that you want to replace or to return begins. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	lv	\<emph\>Length:\</emph\> Numeric expression that returns the number of characters that you want to replace or return. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	lv	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid function\</emph\> is omitted, all characters in the string expression from the start position to the end of the string are returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	lv	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\> is less than the length of the text that you want to replace, the text is reduced to the specified length.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	lv	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> The string to replace the string expression (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
