helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	par_id3151211				0	lv	\<emph\>n:\</emph\> Numeric expression that defines the number of characters that you want to return. If \<emph\>n\</emph\> = 0, a zero-length string is returned. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	par_id3158410				0	lv	The following example converts a date in YYYY-MM-DD format to the US date format (MM/DD/YYYY).				20200411 15:09:53
