helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149665				0	lv	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	lv	\<emph\>FileNumber:\</emph\> The data channel number used in the Open statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020302.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Loc Function [Runtime]				20200411 15:09:53
