helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	lv	Returns the month of a year from a serial date that is generated by the DateSerial or the DateValue function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	lv	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	lv	Month (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366				0	lv	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
