helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148947				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020413.xhp\" name=\"RmDir Statement [Runtime]\"\>RmDir Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	lv	Deletes an existing directory from a data medium.				20200411 15:09:53
