helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155113				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select "Yes" to enable the dropdown option for list or combo box controls. A dropdown control field has an arrow button which you can click to open a list of the existing form entries.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
