helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the help URL that is called when you press F1 while the focus is on a particular control. For example, use the format HID:1234 to call the Help-ID with the number 1234.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
