helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146324				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the label of the current control. The label is displayed along with the control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146816				0	lv	You can create multi-line \<emph\>labels\</emph\> by inserting manual line breaks in the label using \<emph\>Shift+Enter\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
