helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	lv	Sub ExampleOr				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	lv	Dim vA as Variant, vB as Variant, vC as Variant, vD as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
