helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10548				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03104700.xhp\"\>Erase Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10558				0	lv	Erases the contents of array elements of fixed size arrays, and releases the memory used by arrays of variable size.				20200411 15:09:53
