helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147348				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01040000.xhp\" name=\"Event-Driven Macros\"\>Event-Driven Macros\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	lv	This section describes how to assign Basic programs to program events.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263				0	lv	You can automatically execute a macro when a specified software event occurs by assigning the desired macro to the event. The following table provides an overview of program events and at what point an assigned macro is executed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	lv	Event				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	lv	An assigned macro is executed...				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	lv	Program Start				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	lv	... after a $[officename] application is started.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146914				0	lv	Program End				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153765				0	lv	...before a $[officename] application is terminated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145150				0	lv	Create Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808				0	lv	...after a new document is created with \<emph\>File - New\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>New\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	lv	Open Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572				0	lv	...after a document is opened with \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153266				0	lv	Save Document As				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208				0	lv	...before a document is saved under a specified name (with \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>, or with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, if a document name has not yet been specified).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158215				0	lv	Document has been saved as				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150980				0	lv	... after a document was saved under a specified name (with \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>, or with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, if a document name has not yet been specified).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	lv	Save Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529				0	lv	...before a document is saved with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, provided that a document name has already been specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149404				0	lv	Document has been saved				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151332				0	lv	...after a document is saved with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, provided that a document name has already been specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171				0	lv	Document is closing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146868				0	lv	...before a document is closed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159097				0	lv	Document closed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148606				0	lv	...after a document was closed. Note that the "Save Document" event may also occur when the document is saved before closing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144772				0	lv	Activate Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149442				0	lv	...after a document is brought to the foreground.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150888				0	lv	Deactivate Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154060				0	lv	...after another document is brought to the foreground.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152384				0	lv	Print Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152873				0	lv	...after the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog is closed, but before the actual print process begins.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159227				0	lv	JavaScript run-time error				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145362				0	lv	...when a JavaScript run-time error occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154767				0	lv	Print Mail Merge				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153555				0	lv	...after the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog is closed, but before the actual print process begins. This event occurs for each copy printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156366				0	lv	Change of the page count				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154627				0	lv	...when the page count changes.				20200411 15:09:53
