helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	lv	REM Prefix definitions for variable types:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156424				0	lv	DefBool b				20200411 15:09:53
