helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020403.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153126				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020403.xhp\"\>CurDir Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020403.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	lv	Returns a variant string that represents the current path of the specified drive.				20200411 15:09:53
