helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020403.xhp	0	help	par_id3153193				0	lv	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that specifies an existing drive (for example, "C" for the first partition of the first hard drive).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020403.xhp	0	help	par_id3155133				0	lv	If no drive is specified or if the drive is a zero-length string (""), CurDir returns the path for the current drive. $[officename] Basic reports an error if the syntax of the drive description is incorrect, the drive does not exist, or if the drive letter occurs after the letter defined in the CONFIG.SYS with the Lastdrive statement.				20200411 15:09:53
