helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	lv	\<emph\>FileNumber:\</emph\> Any integer expression that determines the file number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	lv	\<emph\>Position:\</emph\> For files opened in Random mode, \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is the number of the record that you want to read.				20200411 15:09:53
