helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153683				0	lv	List of search engines				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	lv	When you have selected a search engine, $[officename] transfers the search request to your standard web browser, which then establishes an Internet connection to the search engine and displays the result. See also \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09010000.xhp\" name=\"URL Name\"\>URL Name\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
