helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveUp\"\>Positions the selected paragraph before the one above it.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283	5			0	lv	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Up \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Up \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Up \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	lv	This function can be called by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Up Arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
