helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143284				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>database contents; inserting as text\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143284	3			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_AS_TEXT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as text.\</ahelp\>If you select the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> option in the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, the content of the data selected in the data source browser is inserted into the document as text. In the dialog, you can decide which database fields or columns are transferred, and how the text is formatted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289				0	lv	If several records are selected when you choose the \<emph\>Data to Text\</emph\> function, the mail merge fields will be inserted according to the number of records.				20200411 15:09:53
