helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\flowcharts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10567				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Flowchart toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\flowcharts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon from the Flowchart toolbar, then drag in the document to draw the shape.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
