helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150693	2			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sorts the data of the selected field in ascending order. \</ahelp\>Text fields are sorted alphabetically, numerical fields are sorted by number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3147276\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sortascending.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147276\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
