helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UseWizards\"\>Specifies whether to start the wizard automatically when inserting a new control.\</ahelp\> This setting applies globally to all documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	lv	There are wizards for inserting a list box or combo box, a table element and group boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
