helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150808				0	lv	The \<emph\>Arrow Style\</emph\> icon is only displayed when you create a drawing with the drawing functions. For more information, see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05200300.xhp\" name=\"Line Styles\"\>\<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\>\</link\> section of the Help.				20200411 15:09:53
