helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafTransparence\"\>Specifies the transparency in the graphic object.\</ahelp\> Values from 0% (fully opaque) to +100% (fully transparent) are possible.				20200411 15:09:53
