helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\08020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143284				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:StatusGetPosition\"\>Displays the current cursor position in the %PRODUCTNAME Basic document. The row number is specified, then the column number.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
