helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576	7			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TEXT_SELECTION_MODE\"\>You can enable a selection cursor in a read-only text document or in the Help. Choose \<emph\>Edit - Select Text \</emph\>or open the context menu of a read-only document and choose \<emph\>Select Text\</emph\>. The selection cursor does not blink.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
