helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149999				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:IncrementLevel\"\>Moves the selected paragraph up one level in the numbering or bullets hierarchy.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
