helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148520				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/06110000.xhp\" name=\"Move Down\"\>Move Down\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154228				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveDown\"\>Positions the selected paragraph after the one below it.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158405	5			0	lv	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Down \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Down \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149751				0	lv	This function can be called by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down Arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
