helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Events				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148643				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>controls; events\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>events; controls\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>macros; assigning to events in forms\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148643				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170103.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152350	2			0	lv	On the\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page you can link macros to events that occur in a form's control fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	lv	When the event occurs, the linked macro will be called. To assign a macro to an event, press the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. An \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Assign Macro\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>dialog\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	lv	Depending on the control, different events are available. Only the available events for the selected control and context are listed on the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab page. The following events are defined:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149191				0	lv	Approve action				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example, clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Approve action\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	lv	Execute action				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ACTIONPERFORMED\"\>The \<emph\>Execute action\</emph\> event occurs when an action is started.\</ahelp\> For example, if you have a "Submit" button in your form, the send process represents the action to be initiated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156343				0	lv	Changed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148755	42			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Changed \</emph\>event takes place when the control loses the focus and the content of the control has changed since it lost the focus.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524				0	lv	Text modified				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495	11			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Text modified \</emph\>event takes place if you enter or modify a text in an input field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	lv	Item status changed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870	9			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Item status changed \</emph\>event takes place if the status of the control field has changed.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Item status changed\</emph\> event takes place if he status of the control field has changed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	lv	When receiving focus				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	17			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSGAINED\"\>The\<emph\> When receiving focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field receives the focus.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447				0	lv	When losing focus				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252	19			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSLOST\"\>The\<emph\> When losing focus \</emph\>event takes place if a control field looses the focus.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147287				0	lv	Key pressed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940	21			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYTYPED\"\>The \<emph\>Key pressed \</emph\>event occurs when the user presses any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\> This event may be linked to a macro for checking entries.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154127				0	lv	Key released				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150	44			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYUP\"\>The\<emph\> Key released \</emph\>event occurs when the user releases any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154921				0	lv	Mouse inside				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	27			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEENTERED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse inside \</emph\>event takes place if the mouse is inside the control field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	lv	Mouse moved while key pressed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	31			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEDRAGGED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved while key pressed \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is dragged while a key is pressed.\</ahelp\> An example is when, during drag-and-drop, an additional key determines the mode (move or copy).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262				0	lv	Mouse moved				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	33			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEMOVED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse moves over the control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159197				0	lv	Mouse button pressed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271	23			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEPRESSED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button pressed \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is pressed while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BD				0	lv	Note that this event is also used for notifying requests for a popup context menu on the control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880				0	lv	Mouse button released				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150659	25			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSERELEASED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse button released \</emph\>event occurs if the mouse button is released while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286				0	lv	Mouse outside				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	29			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEEXITED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse outside \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is outside the control field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Show Draw Functions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150476				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>Drawing bar\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines; draw functions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>polygon drawing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>freeform lines; draw functions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text boxes; positioning\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>headings; entering as text box\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text objects; draw functions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>ticker text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; animating\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>vertical callouts\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>vertical text boxes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cube drawing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>triangle drawing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>ellipse drawing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rectangle drawing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>shapes\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152363				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Show Draw Functions\"\>Show Draw Functions\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertDraw\"\>Click to open or close the \<emph\>Drawing \</emph\>bar, where you can add shapes, lines, text, and callouts to the current document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10849				0	lv	You can switch on and off the Drawing toolbar of Writer and Calc documents using an icon on the Standard toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3153683\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertdraw.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153683\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153032				0	lv	Show Draw Functions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1089D				0	lv	You can show and hide the \<emph\>Visible Buttons\</emph\>. Click the arrow at the end of the toolbar to access the \<emph\>Visible Buttons\</emph\> command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149398				0	lv	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3153824\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawselect.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153824\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	lv	Lets you select objects in the current document. To select an object, click the object with the arrow. To select more than one object, drag a selection frame around the objects. To add an object to a selection, press Shift, and then click the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143270				0	lv	Line				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154897				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3147618\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_line.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147618\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Line\"\>Draws a straight line where you drag in the current document. To constrain the line to 45 degrees, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	lv	To enter text on a line, double-click the line and type or paste your text. The text direction corresponds to the direction you dragged to draw the line. To hide the line, select \<emph\>Invisible\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Line Style\</emph\> box on the \<emph\>Drawing Object Properties\</emph\> bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152922				0	lv	Rectangle				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154125				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3158407\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_rect.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3158407\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147230				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Rect\"\>Draws a rectangle where you drag in the current document. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153367				0	lv	Ellipse				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156443				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3153951\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_ellipse.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153951\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ellipse\"\>Draws an oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155308				0	lv	Polygon				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154129				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3152576\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_polygon_unfilled.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152576\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147214				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Polygon_Unfilled\"\>Draws a line composed of a series of straight line segments. Drag to draw a line segment, click to define the endpoint of the line segment, and then drag to draw a new line segment. Double-click to finish drawing the line. To create a closed shape, double-click the starting point of the line.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	lv	Hold the Shift key while drawing a polygon to position new points at 45 degree angles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	lv	The \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Points\"\>Edit Points\</link\> mode enables you to interactively modify the individual points of the polygon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153279				0	lv	Curve				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3149379\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_bezier_unfilled.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149379\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148878	57			0	lv	\<variable id=\"kurvetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bezier_Unfilled\"\>Draws a smooth Bezier curve. Click where you want the curve to start, drag, release, and then move the pointer to where you want the curve to end and click. Move the pointer and click again to add a straight line segment to the curve. Double-click to finish drawing the curve. To create a closed shape, double click the starting point of the curve.\</ahelp\> The arc of the curve is determined by the distance you drag. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148587				0	lv	Freeform Line				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3154510\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_linetoolbox.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154510\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154163				0	lv	\<variable id=\"freihandtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Freeline_Unfilled\"\>Draws a freeform line where you drag in the current document. To end the line, release the mouse button. To draw a closed shape, release the mouse button near the starting point of the line.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147259				0	lv	Arc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156359				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3153710\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_arc.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153710\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148482				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Arc\"\>Draws an arc in the current document. To draw an arc, drag an oval to the size you want, and then click to define the starting point of the arc. Move your pointer to where you want to place the endpoint and click. You do not need to click on the oval. To draw an arc that is based on a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153924				0	lv	Ellipse Pie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154363				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3159186\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_pie.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159186\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156383				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Pie\"\>Draws a filled shape that is defined by the arc of an oval and two radius lines in the current document. To draw an ellipse pie, drag an oval to the size you want, and then click to define the first radius line. Move your pointer to where you want to place the second radius line and click. You do not need to click on the oval. To draw a circle pie, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154964				0	lv	Circle Segment				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151017				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3147315\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_circlecut.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147315\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149106				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CircleCut\"\>Draws a filled shape that is defined by the arc of a circle and a diameter line in the current document. To draw a circle segment, drag a circle to the size you want, and then click to define the starting point of the diameter line. Move your pointer to where you want to place the endpoint of the diameter line and click. You do not need to click on the circle. To draw an ellipse segment, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145150				0	lv	Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3155608\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_texttoolbox.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155608\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154657				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DrawText\"\>Draws a text box with horizontal text direction where you drag in the current document. Drag a text box to the size you want anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text. Rotate the text box to get rotated text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158214				0	lv	Text Animation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150380				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3152580\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_text_marquee.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152580\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150826	63			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Text_Marquee\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts animated text with horizontal text direction into the current document. Drag a text box, and then type or paste your text. To assign an animation effect, choose \<emph\>Format - Text - Text Animation\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>\<variable id=\"lauftext\"\>Inserts animated text with horizontal text direction into the current document. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149966				0	lv	Callouts				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153781				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3145256\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawcaption.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145256\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151274				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DrawCaption\"\>Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout with horizontal text direction from where you drag in the current document. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E50				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Points\"\>Points\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E60				0	lv	Enables you to edit points on your drawing.				20200411 15:09:53
