helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E95				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/3dsettings_toolbar.xhp\"\>Extrusion On/Off\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10EA5				0	lv	Switches the 3D effects on and off for the selected objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149735				0	lv	Vertical Callouts				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156068				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3154818\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_verticalcaption.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154818\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150492				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:VerticalCaption\"\>Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout with vertical text direction from where you drag in the current document. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand. Only available when Asian language support is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166437				0	lv	Vertical Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146929				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3154372\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_verticaltext.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154372\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152989				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:VerticalText\"\>Draws a text box with vertical text direction where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text. You can also move the cursor to where you want to add the text, drag a text box, and then type or paste your text. Only available when Asian language support is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/insert_graphic_drawit.xhp\" name=\"Tips\"\>Tips for working with the \<emph\>Drawing \</emph\>bar.\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154228				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170901.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\"\>Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	lv	Specifies a table from the available database tables that contains the data field whose content should be displayed as a list entry.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	lv	For list boxes, a table that can be linked with the current form table is indicated. The link table must have at least one field in common with the table of the current form. This makes it possible to establish an unambiguous reference.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	lv	For combo boxes, there must be a relationship between the form table and the table containing the data to be displayed in the combo box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	lv	Table				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338	7			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_LCW_CONTENTSELECTION_TABLE_LB_SELECTTABLE\"\>In the\<emph\> Table \</emph\>field, select the table containing the data field whose content should be displayed in the control field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	lv	The table given here appears in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Control properties\</link\> as an element of an SQL statement in the \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
