helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\blockarrows.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Block Arrows toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\blockarrows.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059A				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon from the Block Arrows toolbar, then drag in the document to draw the shape.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\blockarrows.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059D				0	lv	Some shapes have a special handle which you can drag to change properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				20200411 15:09:53
