helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_id6200750				0	lv	Some of the shortcut keys may be assigned to your desktop system. Keys that are assigned to the desktop system are not available to %PRODUCTNAME. Try to assign different keys either for %PRODUCTNAME, in \<emph\>Tools - Customize - Keyboard\</emph\>, or in your desktop system.				20200411 15:09:53
