helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495				0	lv	Date format				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	lv	6				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153056				0	lv	Two characters each are taken for day, month, and year in the selected order.				20200411 15:09:53
