helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153323				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01110100.xhp\" name=\"HTML Export - Page 1\"\>HTML Export - Page 1\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	lv	On the first page you can select an existing design or create a new one.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	lv	The settings you select for the export will be automatically saved as a design for other exports. You can enter the design name after clicking \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151226				0	lv	Assign design				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	lv	In this area, you can choose to create a new design and select or delete an existing design.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147291				0	lv	If you delete a design, you will only delete the design information in the Wizard. An export file will not be deleted by this action.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681				0	lv	New design				20200411 15:09:53
