helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149388				0	lv	Existing Design				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE1_OLD_DESIGN\"\>Loads an existing design from the design list to use as a starting point for the steps to follow on the next pages of the Wizard.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
