helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153881				0	lv	No, I only want to save the value in the form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_NO\"\>Specifies that you want to save the reference values in the form only, and not in the database.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
