helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094				0	lv	Determines the type of publication.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151330				0	lv	You can specify if you want to include frames, create a title, or display presentation notes.				20200411 15:09:53
