helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id1005				0	lv	To undock or dock the sidebar window use the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Undock\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Dock\</item\> item respectively.				20200411 15:09:53
