helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2001				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id2001\" src=\"sfx2/res/symphony/sidebar-property-large.png\" width=\"0.25in\" height=\"0.25in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2001\"\>Property deck\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2002				0	lv	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Properties\</item\> deck provides panels for object formatting like font, background color, or object size. The content depends on the currently selected object.				20200411 15:09:53
