helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147341	18			0	lv	When the $[officename] software has been started with this parameter, it can only be ended using the taskmanager (Windows) or the \<emph\>kill \</emph\>command (UNIX based systems).				20200411 15:09:53
