helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153910				0	lv	\<variable id=\"hyperlink_edit\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/hyperlink_edit.xhp\" name=\"Editing Hyperlinks\"\>Editing Hyperlinks\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id4124881				0	lv	When you \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>-click a hyperlink in a Writer document, your web browser opens with the requested web address. If you don't use a mouse, position the cursor inside the hyperlink and open the context menu by Shift+F10, then choose Open Hyperlink.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145071				0	lv	Change the text of a hyperlink as follows				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410	12			0	lv	In Writer documents, you can click anywhere into a hyperlink and edit the visible text. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id2690511				0	lv	If you leave the hyperlink by positioning the cursor somewhere else, only the visible text will be changed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id1983092				0	lv	If you leave the hyperlink by entering a space character directly following the last character, the AutoCorrect - if enabled - will change the target URL to be the same as the visible text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id333262				0	lv	In all document types, you can open the Hyperlink dialog to edit a hyperlink. First set the cursor into the hyperlink or directly in front of the hyperlink, then click the Hyperlink icon on the Standard bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158432				0	lv	Change the URL of a hyperlink as follows				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	lv	Option 1: As described above, open \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink Dialog\"\>Hyperlink Dialog\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	lv	Option 2: Open \<link href=\"text/shared/main0209.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink Bar\"\>Hyperlink Bar\</link\> (\<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\>). Click on the hyperlink, do not release the mouse button and drag the hyperlink to the Hyperlink Bar. Edit the URL on the Hyperlink Bar and press the Return key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148686				0	lv	Change the attribute of all hyperlinks				20200411 15:09:53
