helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	lv	Under Windows only, you can view any $[officename] document in a window of the Microsoft Internet Explorer. Install the ActiveX control in the $[officename] Setup program.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156346				0	lv	Installing the ActiveX control				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3153821				0	lv	Close $[officename] and the Quickstarter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	lv	Click the Start button on the Windows taskbar. Choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	lv	In the Control Panel, click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155				0	lv	In the list, click %PRODUCTNAME, then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	lv	In the Installation Wizard, select \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3159399				0	lv	Open the \<emph\>Optional Components\</emph\> entry and find the \<emph\>ActiveX Control\</emph\> entry. Open the sub menu of the icon and select to install the feature.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	8			0	lv	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\> and \<emph\>Install\</emph\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151384				0	lv	Viewing $[officename] documents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	lv	In Internet Explorer, browse to a web page that contains a link to a $[officename] Writer document, for example.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	lv	Click the link to view the document in the Internet Explorer window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3154072				0	lv	You may still right-click the link to save the file on your harddisk.				20200411 15:09:53
