helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\textmode_change.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491	9			0	lv	The overwrite mode is enabled. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The text cursor is a blinking block. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>Click on the area to enable insert mode.				20200411 15:09:53
