helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609				0	lv	Using a Report				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	lv	%PRODUCTNAME stores the information about the created reports in the database file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> and select the database file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	lv	In the database file window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	lv	Double-click one of the report names to open the report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	lv	These links are added automatically when you create a new report by the Report Wizard or in the Report Builder window.				20200411 15:09:53
