helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A38				0	lv	In the \<emph\>XSLT for import\</emph\> box, enter the path and file name to the XSLT stylesheet that defines the transformation from the external format to OpenDocument format.				20200411 15:09:53
