helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A44				0	lv	The files that are specified on the \<emph\>Transformation\</emph\> tab page are copied to the local %PRODUCTNAME users directory.				20200411 15:09:53
