helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10DEB				0	lv	Click \<emph\>Browse\</emph\>, select the %PRODUCTNAME document that you want to test, and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10DF7				0	lv	To test the current document, click \<emph\>Current Document\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
