helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150789				0	lv	\<variable id=\"ms_user\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/ms_user.xhp\" name=\"Using Microsoft Office and $[officename]\"\>Using Microsoft Office and $[officename]\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	lv	$[officename] can open and save documents in the Microsoft Office file formats. Microsoft Office Open XML formats can be read, but not saved.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345				0	lv	Opening a Microsoft Office File				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>. Select a Microsoft Office file in the $[officename] file open dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
