helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	lv	...will open in $[officename] module				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3153543				0	lv	MS Word, *.doc, *.docx				20200411 15:09:53
