helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	lv	\<variable id=\"data_new\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_new.xhp\"\>Creating a New Database\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CB				0	lv	This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/dabawiz00.xhp\"\>Database Wizard\</link\>, where you create a new database file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DD				0	lv	In the Database Wizard, select the type of database, and select the option to open the Table Wizard as the next wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
