helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10650				0	lv	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Queries\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10658				0	lv	Click \<emph\>Create Query in Design View\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
