helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Mobile Device Filters for Pocket Device Appliances 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147143				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>mobile device filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pocket device appliances\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>$[officename] documents;mobile device filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Palm file filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Pocket PC file filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>saving;documents for mobile devices\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>opening;mobile device documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;Pocket PC formats\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>synchronizing;Pocket PC and $[officename] formats\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>installing;mobile device filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>file filters;mobile devices\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147143				0	lv	\<variable id=\"mobiledevicefilters\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/mobiledevicefilters.xhp\" name=\"Mobile Devices Filters for Pocket Device Appliances\"\>Mobile Devices Filters for Pocket Device Appliances\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	lv	You can save and open documents to and from several mobile devices file formats.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	lv	Currently the following filters are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	lv	AportisDoc for Palm OS compatible devices				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	lv	Pocket Excel for Pocket PC compatible devices				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	lv	Pocket Word for Pocket PC compatible devices				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	lv	Installing the Pocket PC filters under Windows will also install a DLL file that supports the synchronization software of your Pocket PC.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	lv	The Java Runtime Environment is required to use the mobile device filters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153665				0	lv	Installing the mobile device filters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	lv	Close $[officename] and the Quickstarter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	lv	If you are using the Windows operating system with ActiveSync installed, disconnect any Pocket PC device from ActiveSync.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061				0	lv	Start the $[officename] Setup program:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E7				0	lv	Open the Windows \<emph\>Start\</emph\> button, choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>, double-click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>, select the %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION entry, click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	lv	In Setup, choose the \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> option and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	lv	Open the \<emph\>Optional Components\</emph\> entry, then open the \<emph\>Mobile Device Filters\</emph\> entry. Select the filters you want to install.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	lv	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>, \<emph\>Next\</emph\>, \<emph\>Install\</emph\>, \<emph\>Finish\</emph\> to install the filters and exit the Setup program.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	lv	Saving $[officename] documents for a mobile device				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672				0	lv	Open the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box and select the appropriate filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	lv	Enter a name and click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153768				0	lv	Opening mobile device documents in $[officename]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147428				0	lv	Open the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box and select the appropriate filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618				0	lv	Select the file and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159196				0	lv	Synchronizing file types				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	lv	To convert Pocket PC formats to and from $[officename] formats, you must first change some options within ActiveSync. To do this, open the ActiveSync window and open its Options dialog. Perform the following steps:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064				0	lv	Select the \<emph\>Rules\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147216				0	lv	Click the \<emph\>Conversion Settings\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145				0	lv	Click the \<emph\>Device to Desktop\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155				0	lv	Select \<emph\>Pocket Word Document - Pocket PC\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	29			0	lv	In the drop down list of available conversions, select \<emph\>$[officename] Writer \</emph\>and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	lv	Repeat steps 4 and 5 for \<emph\>Pocket Excel Workbook\</emph\> selecting \<emph\>$[officename] Calc\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148389				0	lv	After these steps you can copy documents between $[officename] and your Pocket PC, either by the ActiveSync software or by the Windows Explorer. The filters will be applied to the document files automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
