helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FE				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_SEARCHDIALOG\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Find on this page\</emph\> dialog\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	lv	These commands can also be found in the context menu of the Help document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10922				0	lv	Help Page				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10926				0	lv	You can copy from the Help Viewer to the clipboard on your operating system with standard copy commands. For example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092C				0	lv	On a Help page, select the text that you want to copy.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10930				0	lv	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10933				0	lv	To search the current Help page:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10939				0	lv	Click the \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10940				0	lv	The \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A36				0	lv	You can also click in the Help page and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A22				0	lv	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter the text that you want to find.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A48				0	lv	Select the search options that you want to use.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	lv	Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A59				0	lv	To find the next occurrence of the search term on the page, click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10906				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:ComboBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the text that you want to search for or select a text entry in the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10993				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WHOLEWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds complete words only.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109AA				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_MATCHCASE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distinguishes between uppercase text and lowercase text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C1				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WRAPAROUND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches the entire Help page, starting at the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D8				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_BACKWARDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches backwards from the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109F5				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:PushButton:RID_DLG_SEARCH:PB_FIND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds the next occurrence of the search term.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149202				0	lv	Navigation Pane				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148673				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TABCONTROL\"\>The navigation pane of the Help window contains the tab pages \<emph\>Contents\</emph\>, \<emph\>Index\</emph\>, \<emph\>Find\</emph\> and \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_LISTBOX\"\>The list box located at the very top is where you can select other \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help modules.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Index\</emph\> and \<emph\>Find\</emph\> tab pages only contain the data for the selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Contents\"\>Contents\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	lv	Displays an index of the main topics of all modules.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	lv	Displays a list of index keywords for the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	lv	Allows you to carry out a full-text search. The search will include the entire Help contents of the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Bookmarks\"\>Bookmarks\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156062				0	lv	Contains user-defined bookmarks. You can edit or delete bookmarks, or click them to go to the corresponding pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	lv	The Help references the default settings of the program on a system that is set to defaults. Descriptions of colors, mouse actions, or other configurable items can be different for your program and system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	lv	The \<emph\>$[officename] Help system\</emph\> provides easy access to information and support. There are several ways to find what you are looking for in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>Help environment\</link\>: You can search for a specific keyword in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>, carry out a full-text search under \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, or look through a hierarchical list of the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Topics\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Managing Bookmarks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153244				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>Help; bookmarks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bookmarks; Help\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154349				0	lv	\<variable id=\"doc_title\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Managing Bookmarks\"\>Managing Bookmarks\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3154840				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_EDIT_DLG_HELP_ADDBOOKMARK_ED_BOOKMARK_TITLE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the name of the bookmarked page. You can also type a new name for the bookmark.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140				0	lv	\<image src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\" id=\"img_id3149549\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149549\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	lv	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	lv	You can find the bookmarks on the \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	lv	Use the Del key to delete a selected bookmark.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	lv	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	lv	\<emph\>Display\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>displays the selected help subject\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	lv	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	lv	\<emph\>Delete\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_DELETE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>deletes the bookmark selected \</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Help Page Not Found				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957				0	lv	Could not find Help page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	lv	Unfortunately the Help page you selected was not found. The following data could be helpful in locating the error:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3143268				0	lv	Help ID: \<emph\>\<help-id-missing/\>\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	lv	You can install missing Help modules using the Setup application.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\err_html.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541	16			0	lv	Click \<image id=\"img_id3148946\" src=\"res/sc06301.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148946\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>\<emph\>Back\</emph\> to return to the previous page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Find - The Full-Text Search				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148532				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>Find tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; full-text search\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>full-text search in Help\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148523				0	lv	\<variable id=\"00000140\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find - The Full-Text Search\"\>Find - The Full-Text Search\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155599				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the search term here. The search is not case-sensitive.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to start a full-text search for the term you entered.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_LB_RESULT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the headings of the pages found in your full-text search. To display a page, double-click its entry.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_FULLWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to carry out an exact search for the word you entered. Incomplete words will not be found.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_SCOPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to only search in document headings for the search term.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_OPEN_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the entry selected in the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3152552				0	lv	The full text search function in $[officename] Help allows you to find Help documents that contain any combination of search terms. To do this, type one or more words into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	lv	The \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field stores the words you entered last. To repeat a previous search, click the arrow icon and select the term from the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	lv	After the search has been carried out, the document headings of the results appear in a list. Either double-click an entry, or select it and click \<emph\>Display\</emph\> to load the corresponding Help document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	lv	Use the check box \<emph\>Find in headings only\</emph\> to limit the search to document headings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	lv	The \<emph\>Complete words only\</emph\> check box allows you to perform an exact search. If this box is marked, incomplete words will not be found. Do not mark this check box if the search term you enter should also be found as part of a longer word.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	lv	You can enter any combination of search terms, separated by spaces. Searching is not case-sensitive.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	lv	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Chart options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345				0	lv	Chart options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	lv	\<variable id=\"farbe\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Defines the general settings for charts.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Microsoft Office				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156410				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01130200.xhp\" name=\"Microsoft Office\"\>Microsoft Office\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095				0	lv	Specifies the settings for importing and exporting Microsoft Office OLE objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	lv	These settings are valid when no Microsoft OLE server exists (for example, in UNIX) or when there is no $[officename] OLE server ready for editing the OLE objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364795				0	lv	If an OLE server is active for the embedded object, then the OLE server will be used to handle the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364725				0	lv	If no OLE server is active for MathType objects, then embedded MathType objects can be converted to %PRODUCTNAME Math objects. For this conversion, the embedded MathType objects must not exceed the MathType 3.1 specifications.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146798				0	lv	List Box				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670	4			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFAPAGE_MSFLTR2_CLB\"\>The\<emph\> List Box \</emph\>field displays the entries for the pair of OLE objects that can be converted when loading into $[officename] (L) and/or when saving into a Microsoft format (S). \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154286				0	lv	Mark the box in the [L] column in front of the entry if a Microsoft OLE object is to be converted into the specified $[officename] OLE object when a Microsoft document is loaded into $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	lv	Mark the box in the [S] column in front of the entry if a $[officename] OLE object is to be converted into the specified Microsoft OLE object when a document is saved in a Microsoft file format.				20200411 15:09:53
