helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_TBLREG\"\>Specifies whether to display the sheet tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet document.\</ahelp\> If this box is not checked, you will only be able to switch between the sheets through the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Navigator\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Note that there is a slider between the horizontal scrollbar and the sheet tabs that may be set to one end.				20200411 15:09:53
