helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150359				0	lv	Memory per object (MB)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_NUMERICFIELD_OFA_TP_MEMORY_NF_GRAPHICOBJECTCACHE\"\>Specifies that objects which are larger than the selected megabytes will not be placed in the cache.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148920				0	lv	Remove from memory after (hh:mm)				20200411 15:09:53
