helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_OPTIONS_CTL_LB_NUMERALS\"\>Selects the type of numerals used within text, text in objects, fields, and controls, in all \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> modules. Only cell contents of \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc are not affected.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	lv	Arabic: All numbers are shown using Arabic numerals. This is the default.				20200411 15:09:53
