helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343				0	lv	To record changes to your work, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Changes\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
