helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792				0	lv	Defines colors for recorded changes. If you select the "By author" entry, $[officename] will automatically set the color depending on the author who undertook the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
