helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Defines the security options for saving documents, for web connections, and for opening documents that contain macros.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
