helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id5616626				0	lv	The Security options and warnings dialog contains the following controls:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10647				0	lv	When saving or sending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"703988739\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to save or send a document that contains recorded changes, versions, or comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064E				0	lv	When printing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10652				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"703988740\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to print a document that contains recorded changes or comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	lv	When signing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10659				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"703988741\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to sign a document that contains recorded changes, versions, fields, references to other sources (for example linked sections or linked pictures), or comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065C				0	lv	When creating PDF files				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"703988742\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to export a document to PDF format that displays recorded changes in Writer, or that displays comments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	lv	Remove personal information on saving				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"703988743\"\>Select to always remove user data from the file properties. If this option is not selected, you can still remove the personal information for the current document with the \<emph\>Reset\</emph\> button on \<emph\>File - Properties - General\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	lv	Recommend password protection on saving				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10680				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"703988744\"\>Select to always enable the \<emph\>Save with password\</emph\> option in the file save dialogs. Deselect the option to save files by default without password.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id1972106				0	lv	Ctrl-click required to follow hyperlinks				20200411 15:09:53
