helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125864				0	lv	Do not split (not in HTML)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_DONT_SPLIT\"\>Specifies that tables are not split by any type of text flow break.\</ahelp\> You can also find this option in menu \<emph\>Table - Table Properties - Text Flow\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
