helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id9971922				0	lv	HTTPS proxy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id5319071				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Type the name of the proxy server for HTTPS. Type the port in the right-hand field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
