helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778809				0	lv	HSB				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778809				0	lv	These set of controls allow to choose a color in the HSB color space.				20200411 15:09:53
