helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3146913				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts a new record into the current table.\</ahelp\> To create a record, click the asterisk (*) button at the bottom of the table view. An empty row is added at the end of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
