helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148483				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the number of records. For example, "Record 7 of 9(2)" indicates that two records (2) are selected in a table containing 9 records, and that the cursor is in record number 7.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
