helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154398				0	lv	Use replacement table				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151234				0	lv	If you type a letter combination that matches a shortcut in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"replacement table\"\>replacement table\</link\>, the letter combination is replaced with the replacement text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150144				0	lv	Correct TWo INitial CApitals				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	lv	If you type two uppercase letters at the beginning of a "WOrd", the second uppercase letter is automatically replaced with a lowercase letter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156426				0	lv	Capitalize first letter of every sentence.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	lv	Capitalizes the first letter of every sentence.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id5240028				0	lv	The first letter in a Calc cell will never be capitalized automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	lv	Automatic *bold* and _underline_				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	lv	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	lv	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150275				0	lv	URL Recognition				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	lv	Automatically creates a hyperlink when you type a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
