helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230401.xhp	0	help	par_id3154894				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINING_VIEW_PAGE\"\>Accept or reject individual changes.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230401.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511	26			0	lv	The \<emph\>List \</emph\>tab displays all of the changes that were recorded in the current document. If you want to filter this list, click the \<emph\>Filter \</emph\>tab, and then select your \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230402.xhp\" name=\"filter criteria\"\>filter criteria\</link\>.\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\> If the list contains nested changes, the dependencies are shown regardless of the filter. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230401.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114	27			0	lv	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Nested changes occur where changes made by different authors overlap. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02230401.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552	29			0	lv	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Click the plus sign beside an entry in the list to view all of the changes that were recorded for a cell. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
