helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id58				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select margin between individual pages on each sheet of paper.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
