helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id86				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specify how to scale slides in the printout.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id88				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies that you do not want to further scale pages when printing.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id90				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to scale down objects that are beyond the margins of the current printer so they fit on the paper in the printer.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id92				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies that pages are to be printed in tiled format. If the pages or slides are smaller than the paper, several pages or slides will be printed on one page of paper.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285074				0	lv	%PRODUCTNAME Writer / Calc / Impress / Draw / Math				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285019				0	lv	The tab page with the same name as the current application can be used to define the contents, color, size, and pages to be printed. You define settings that are specific to the current document type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285112				0	lv	Page Layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285150				0	lv	The Page Layout tab page can be used to save some sheets of paper by printing several pages onto each sheet of paper. You define the arrangement and size of output pages on the physical paper.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904164735				0	lv	Change the arrangement of pages to be printed on every sheet of paper. The preview shows how every final sheet of paper will look.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904102987				0	lv	For some document types, you can choose to print a brochure.				20200411 15:09:53
