helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01190000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	lv	If you save a copy of a file that contains version information (by choosing \<emph\>File - Save As)\</emph\>, the version information is not saved with the file.				20200411 15:09:53
