helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155616				0	lv	The changes are applied to the current selection, to the entire word that contains the cursor, or to the new text that you type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	lv	Depending on your language settings, you can change the formatting for the following font types:				20200411 15:09:53
