helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Groups keep together selected objects, so that they can be moved or formatted as a single object.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
