helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	lv	When you open a file that contains links, you are prompted to update the links. Depending on where the linked files are stored, the update process can take several minutes to complete.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	lv	If you are loading a file that contains DDE links, you are prompted to update the links. Decline the update if you do not want to establish a connection to the DDE server.				20200411 15:09:53
