helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02180000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1099856				0	lv	When you open a file by an URL from the Windows file dialog, Windows will open a local copy of the file, located in the Internet Explorer cache. The %PRODUCTNAME file dialog opens the remote file.				20200411 15:09:53
