helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145667	37			0	lv	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>You can also link sheets within the same spreadsheet. When you link to other files, a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#dde\" name=\"DDE link\"\>DDE link\</link\> is automatically created. A DDE link is inserted as a matrix formula and can only be modified as a whole. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
