helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	lv	The name of the database field is bounded by brackets in the \<emph\>Label text\</emph\> box. If you want, you can separate database fields with spaces. Press Enter to insert a database field on a new line.				20200411 15:09:53
