helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_LAB_LAB_BOX_TYPE\"\>Select the size format that you want to use. The available formats depend on the brand on what you selected in the \<emph\>Brand\</emph\> list. If you want to use a custom label format, select \<emph\>[User]\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010202.xhp\" name=\"Format\"\>\<emph\>Format\</emph\>\</link\> tab to define the format.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
