helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_SPELLCHECK_BTN_OPTIONS\"\>Opens a dialog, where you can select the user-defined dictionaries, and set the rules for the spellchecking.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
