helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ObjectPosition\"\>Changes the stacking order of the selected object(s).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153894				0	lv	Layer for text and graphics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	lv	Each object that you place in your document is successively stacked on the preceding object. Use the arrange commands to change the stacking order of objects in your document. You cannot change the stacking order of text.				20200411 15:09:53
