helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\formatting_mark.xhp	0	help	par_id6690878				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts a text direction mark that affects the text direction of any text following the mark. Available when complex text layout (CTL) is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
