helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Gallery\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, where you can select graphics and sounds to insert into your document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	44			0	lv	You can display the contents of the \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>as icons, or icons with titles and path information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	lv	To zoom in or zoom out on a single object in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, double-click the object, or select the object, and then press the Spacebar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3145346				0	lv	Themes are listed on the left side of the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_THEMELIST\"\>Click a theme to view the objects associated with the theme.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155355	50			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_WINDOW\"\>To insert a \<emph\>Gallery \</emph\>object, select the object, and then drag it into the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156113				0	lv	Adding a New File to the Gallery				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153032				0	lv	To add a file to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, right-click a theme, choose \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Files \</emph\>tab, and then click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>. You can also click an object in the current document, hold, and then drag it to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145315				0	lv	New theme				20200411 15:09:53
