helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	lv	Use this command to quickly apply font styles to a text selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	lv	If you place the cursor in a word and do not make a selection, the font style is applied to the entire word. If the cursor is not inside a word, and no text is selected, then the font style is applied to the text that you type.				20200411 15:09:53
