helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the display properties of a grid.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057E				0	lv	Display Grid				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN10582				0	lv	Displays or hides grid lines that you can use to align objects such as graphics on a page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN10585				0	lv	Snap to Grid				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	lv	Automatically aligns objects to vertical and horizontal grid lines. To override this feature, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you drag an object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C9				0	lv	Grid to Front				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CD				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the grid lines in front of the objects on the slide or page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_id4372692				0	lv	Set the grid color on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\"\>Appearance\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
