helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154984				0	lv	Illumination				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	lv	Specify the light source for the object, as well as the color of the light source and of the ambient light. You can define up to eight different light sources.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153748				0	lv	Light source				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	7			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXFLOAT_3D:BTN_LIGHT_8\"\>Click twice to turn the light source on, and then select a color for the light from the list. If you want, you can also set the color of the surrounding light, by selecting a color from the \<emph\>Ambient light\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> You can also press the Spacebar to turn the light source on or off. 				20200411 15:09:53
