helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152594				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FULLSCREENTOOLBOX\"\>In Writer and Calc, you can also use the shortcut keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+J to switch between the normal and full screen mode.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154318	28			0	lv	You can still use shortcut keys in \<emph\>Full Screen\</emph\> mode, even though the menus are unavailable. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>To open the \<emph\>View\</emph\> menu, press Alt+V. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
