helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_CHECKBOX_TAB_WIZ_COPYTABLE_CB_PRIMARY_COLUMN\"\>Automatically generates a primary key data field and fills it with values.\</ahelp\> You should always use this field, since a primary key must always be available in order to edit the table.				20200411 15:09:53
