helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2711264				0	lv	The Properties window of the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> always shows the properties of the currently selected object in the Report Builder view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1080660				0	lv	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift-F1\</item\> and point with the mouse at an input box to see a help text for this input box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7175817				0	lv	On first start of the Report Builder, the Properties window shows the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page for the whole report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id9895931				0	lv	Select a table from the Contents list, then press Tab or click outside the input box to leave the input box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3587145				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Add Field window is shown automatically when you have selected a table in the Contents box and leave that box. You can also click the Add Field icon on the toolbar, or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Add Field\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6993926				0	lv	The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page can be used to change the name of the report, and to disable the Page Header or Page Footer areas, among others.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3729361				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To display the Data or General tab page for the whole report, choose Edit - Select Report.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1768852				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Groups are kept together by page or by column (default). You must enable Keep Together also.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6304818				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies in which context the page header will be printed: on all pages, or not on pages with a report header or footer.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id401623				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies in which context the page footer will be printed: on all pages, or not on pages with a report header or footer\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2162236				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies to print repeated values.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7022003				0	lv	If you click the Page Header or Page Footer area without selecting any object, you see the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page for that area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7004303				0	lv	You can edit some visual properties for the area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2561723				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the background color for the selected object, both on screen and for printing.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1064485				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>An invisible object is not shown in the executed report. It is still visible in the Report Builder view.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2356028				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Defines the height of the selected object.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1404461				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If the Conditional Print Expression evaluates to TRUE, the selected object will be printed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7404705				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether the background of the selected object is transparent or opaque.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7466963				0	lv	If you click the \<emph\>Detail\</emph\> area without selecting any object, you see the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page for that area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3644215				0	lv	You can specify some properties to fine-tune the way the records are printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3148899				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Force New Page specifies whether the current section and/or the next section is printed on a new page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6164433				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>New Row Or Column specifies, for a multi-column design, whether the current section and/or the next section will be printed on a new row or column.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7405011				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Keep Together specifies to print the current object starting on top of a new page if it doesn't fit on the current page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1536606				0	lv	Insert some data fields into the Detail area, or insert other control fields into any area. When you select an inserted field, you can set the properties in the Properties window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id9631641				0	lv	For a Label field, you can change the displayed text in the Label input box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7749565				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For a picture, you can specify to either insert the picture as a link to a file or only as an embedded object in the Base file. The embedded option increases the size of the Base file, while the link option is not as portable to other computers.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id4041871				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Set the X Position for the selected object\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
