helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148895				0	lv	... the content of the field is identical to the indicated expression.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153120				0	lv	The operator = will not be displayed in the query fields. If you enter a value without any operator, the operator = will be automatically adopted.				20200411 15:09:53
