helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10564				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to group the query by any of the conditions using a logical OR.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
