helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Changes the password for the selected user.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05000003.xhp\" name=\"Change Password\"\>Change Password\</link\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
