helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163829				0	lv	Enter / change password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	lv	Allows you to enter and confirm a new or changed password. If you have defined a new user, enter the user's name in this dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
