helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10625				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the type of Boolean comparison that you want to use.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
