helpcontent2	source\text\smath\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155927				0	lv	Left or right arrow				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	lv	Move left or right to the next category or function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150928				0	lv	Enter key				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148390				0	lv	Selects a category (within the category section) or inserts a function in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window (within the function section).				20200411 15:09:53
