helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145206				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:PUSHBUTTON:RID_FONTSIZEDIALOG:1\"\>Click this button to save your changes as a default for all new formulas.\</ahelp\> A security response appears before saving any changes.				20200411 15:09:53
