helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154621				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XOVERBRACEY\"\>Inserts a scalable horizontal upper brace with placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also enter \<emph\><?> overbrace <?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. The bracket size is adjusted automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN104A0				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3149646\" src=\"starmath/res/al21826.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.25inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149646\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
