helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153518				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FROMXTOY\"\>Inserts a range statement \<emph\>upper and lower limit\</emph\> for integral and summation with one placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>from{<?>} to{<?>} <?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. Limit statements must be combined with the appropriate operators. The limits will be centered above/below the summation character.				20200411 15:09:53
