helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150556				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_FROMX\"\>Inserts a \<emph\>lower limit\</emph\> range statement for integral and sum with placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>from {<?>}<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
