helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3147309				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LSUBX\"\>Inserts a subscript to the left of a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>lsub{<?>}\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
