helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150687				0	lv	Subscript bottom				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_CSUBX\"\>Inserts a subscript directly under a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>csub<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10226				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3145265\" src=\"starmath/res/co21904.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145265\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
