helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH_CHECKBOX_DLG_AXIS_CB_X_PRIMARY\"\>Displays the X axis as a line with subdivisions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147003				0	lv	Y axis				20200411 15:09:53
