helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	lv	The \<link href=\"text/schart/01/05040200.xhp\" name=\"Y axis\"\>Y axis\</link\> has an enhanced dialog. For X-Y charts, the X axis chart is also enhanced by the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/05040201.xhp\" name=\"Scaling\"\>\<emph\>Scaling\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
