helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159128				0	lv	Minor:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146885				0	lv	This area is used to define the marking dashes between the axis marks. It is possible to activate both fields. This will result in a marking line running from the outside to the inside.				20200411 15:09:53
