helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059C				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the amount of time before the slide show automatically advances to the next slide.\</ahelp\> This option is only available for automatic transition.				20200411 15:09:53
