helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154320				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ClickChangeRotation\"\>Changes the mouse-click behavior, so that rotation handles appear after you click an object, and then click it again.\</ahelp\> Drag a handle to rotate the object in the direction you want.				20200411 15:09:53
