helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150354				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Polygon_Diagonal_Unfill\"\>Draws a line composed of a series of straight line segments, that are constrained by angles of 45 degree. Drag to draw a line segment, click to define the endpoint of the line segment, and then drag to draw a new line segment. Double-click to finish drawing the line. To create a closed shape, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and double-click.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
