helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\13090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151074				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SolidCreate\"\>If this icon on the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> bar is activated, objects are shown with their attributes, but with 50% transparency, while you move or draw them.\</ahelp\> If this icon is not activated, only a contour is shown while drawing, and the object is shown with all attributes when you release the mouse button.				20200411 15:09:53
