helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextFitToSizeTool\"\>Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. The text that you enter is automatically resized to fit the dimensions of the text box.\</ahelp\> Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				20200411 15:09:53
