helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146963				0	lv	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147300				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3151391\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_ellipse.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151391\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
