helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148725				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Circle\"\>Draws a filled circle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the circle, and drag to the size you want. To draw an ellipse, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153930				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3153936\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_circle.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153936\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
