helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153514				0	lv	Circle Arc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147075				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CircleArc\"\>Draws an arc that is based on a circle in the current document. To draw an arc, drag a circle to the size you want, and then click to define the starting point of the arc. Move your pointer to where you want to place the endpoint and click. You do not need to click on the circle. To draw an arc that is based on an ellipse, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154380				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3154386\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_circlearc.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154386\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
