helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145303				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Sphere\"\>Draws a filled sphere where you drag in the slide. To draw a spheroid, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155985				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3155992\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sphere.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155992\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
