helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153774				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Shell3D\"\>Draws a bowl-shaped object that is based on a circle where you drag in the slide. To draw a shell that is based on an oval, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3150838\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shell3d.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150838\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
