helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149310				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3151328\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_halfsphere.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151328\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
