helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150199				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>flipping around a flip line\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>mirroring objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>3D rotation objects; converting to\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>slanting objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects; effects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>distorting objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>shearing objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>transparency; of objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gradients; transparent\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colors; defining gradients interactively\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>gradients; defining colors\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>circles; of objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
