helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150930				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3150936\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_connectorarrowend.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150936\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
