helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	lv	To create a flowchart:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	lv	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	lv	Drag a shape in your slide.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	lv	To add more shapes, repeat the last steps.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146967	43			0	lv	Open the \<emph\>Connectors \</emph\>toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and select a connector line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3149945				0	lv	Move the pointer over the edge of a shape so that the connection sites appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146871				0	lv	Click a connection site, drag to a connection site on another shape, and then release.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	lv	To add more connectors, repeat the last steps.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153036				0	lv	You now have the basic outline for your flowchart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155255				0	lv	To add text to the shapes on your flowchart				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150865				0	lv	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145592				0	lv	Double-click the shape, and type or paste your text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154504				0	lv	Click the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and drag a text object over the shape. Type or paste your text into the text object.				20200411 15:09:53
