helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\layer_new.xhp	0	help	par_id3155068	12			0	lv	Type a name for the layer in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\layer_new.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382	15			0	lv	In the \<emph\>Properties \</emph\>area, set the options for the layer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\layer_new.xhp	0	help	par_id3153964				0	lv	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The new layer automatically becomes the active layer.				20200411 15:09:53
