helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150199	33			0	lv	            \<variable id=\"background\"\>                \<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/background.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Slide Background Fill\"\>Changing the Slide Background Fill\</link\>            \</variable\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3155067				0	lv	You can change the background color or the background fill of the current slide or all of the slides in your document. For a background fill, you can use hatching, a gradient, or a bitmap image.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3148701				0	lv	If you want to change the background fill for all of the slides, choose \<emph\>View - Master - Slide Master\</emph\>. To change the background fill of a single slide, choose \<emph\>View - Normal\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id624713				0	lv	            \<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click Set Background Picture for Slide in the context menu of a slide in Normal view to select a bitmap file. This file is used as a background picture.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
