helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	lv	Specifies the timing for the current effect in the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
