helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066F				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"878841346\"\>Displays the start property of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\> The following start properties are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10675				0	lv	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	lv	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10683				0	lv	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				20200411 15:09:53
