helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10693				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"878844420\"\>Specifies an additional delay of n seconds until the effect starts.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
