helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B3				0	lv	\<emph\>(none)\</emph\> - the effect is not repeated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BA				0	lv	\<emph\>Until next click\</emph\> - the animation is repeated until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
