helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:TIMEFIELD:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:TMF_PAUSE\"\>Enter the duration of the pause before the slide show is repeated. If you enter zero, the show restarts immediately without showing a pause slide.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
