helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000m.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertRows\"\>Inserts a new row above the active cell. The number of rows inserted correspond to the number of rows selected. The existing rows are moved downward.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000m.xhp	0	help	par_id091620081118197				0	lv	In the context menu of a cell, choose \<emph\>Insert - Rows\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
