helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150207	8			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_MORPH:CBX_ATTRIBUTES\"\>Applies cross-fading to the line and fill properties of the selected objects.\</ahelp\>For example, if the selected objects are filled with different colors, a color transition between the two colors is applied.				20200411 15:09:53
