helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	lv	Formatting Tables and Cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154022				0	lv	Entering Values and Formulas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152899				0	lv	Entering References				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155382				0	lv	Database Ranges in Tables				20200411 15:09:53
