helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\specialfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147372				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>Data - Filter - Advanced Filter\</emph\>, and then select the range A20:E22. After you click OK, only the filtered rows will be displayed. The other rows will be hidden from view.				20200411 15:09:53
