helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3145324				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060116.xhp\" name=\"Analysis functions Part Two\"\>Analysis functions Part Two\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
