helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3153960				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_BESSELI\"\>Calculates the modified Bessel function.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150392				0	lv	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3147295				0	lv	BESSELI(X; N)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3151338				0	lv	\<emph\>X\</emph\> is the value on which the function will be calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	lv	\<emph\>N\</emph\> is the order of the Bessel function				20200411 15:09:53
