helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3153015				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_BESSELJ\"\>Calculates the Bessel function (cylinder function).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
