helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150014				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>DELTA function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>recognizing;equal numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
