helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3148760				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DELTA\"\>The result is TRUE (1) if both numbers, which are delivered as an argument, are equal, otherwise it is FALSE (0).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
