helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3157971				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>DEC2BIN function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal numbers, into binary numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
