helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3153043				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DEC2BIN\"\> The result is the binary number for the decimal number entered between -512 and 511.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145349				0	lv	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
