helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3156294				0	lv	\<emph\>UpperLimit\</emph\> is optional. It is the upper limit of the integral. If this value is missing, the calculation takes places between 0 and the lower limit.				20200411 15:09:53
