helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153891				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DISC\"\>Calculates the allowance (discount) of a security as a percentage.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153982				0	lv	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149756				0	lv	DISC("Settlement"; "Maturity"; Price; Redemption; Basis)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156014	383			0	lv	            \<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154304	384			0	lv	            \<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159180	385			0	lv	            \<emph\>Price\</emph\> is the price of the security per 100 currency units of par value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147253	386			0	lv	            \<emph\>Redemption\</emph\> is the redemption value of the security per 100 currency units of par value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151174				0	lv	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	lv	A security is purchased on 2001-01-25; the maturity date is 2001-11-15. The price (purchase price) is 97, the redemption value is 100. Using daily balance calculation (basis 3) how high is the settlement (discount)?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152797	389			0	lv	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DISC("2001-01-25";"2001-11-15";97;100;3)\</item\> returns about 0.0372 or 3.72 per cent.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154695				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>DURATION_ADD function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>Microsoft Excel functions\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>durations;fixed interest securities\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
