helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144936				0	lv	\<emph\>ArrayY\</emph\> represents the second array whose elements are to be squared and subtracted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D6B				0	lv	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
