helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166062				0	lv	TREND				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166091				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TREND\"\>Returns values along a linear trend.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
