helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166346				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VARIATION\"\>Calculates the points of an exponential trend in an array.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
