helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3153538				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MONAT\"\>Returns the month for the given date value.\</ahelp\> The month is returned as an integer between 1 and 12.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149517				0	lv	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3145602				0	lv	MONTH(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	lv	\<emph\>Number\</emph\>, as a time value, is a decimal for which the month is to be returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153322				0	lv	Examples				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3149244				0	lv	=MONTH(NOW()) returns the current month.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_month.xhp	0	help	par_id3154790				0	lv	=MONTH(C4) returns 7 if you enter 2000-07-07 to cell C4 (that date value might get formatted differently after you press Enter).				20200411 15:09:53
