helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3150518				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KGROESSTE\"\>Returns the Rank_c-th largest value in a data set.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152990				0	lv	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3154372				0	lv	LARGE(Data; RankC)				20200411 15:09:53
