helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3153814				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KONFIDENZ\"\>Returns the (1-alpha) confidence interval for a normal distribution.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
