helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3153335				0	lv	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CONFIDENCE(0.05;1.5;100)\</item\> gives 0.29.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148746				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>CORREL function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>coefficient of correlation\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
