helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156289				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FreezePanes\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Divides the sheet at the top left corner of the active cell and the area to the top left is no longer scrollable.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Formula Bar				20200411 15:09:53
