helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id3148829				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_JETZT\"\>Returns the computer system date and time.\</ahelp\> The value is updated when you recalculate the document or each time a cell value is modified.				20200411 15:09:53
