helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id964384				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The JIS function converts half-width to full-width ASCII and katakana characters. Returns a text string.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id1551561				0	lv	See \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Calc/Features/JIS_and_ASC_functions\"\>JIS and ASC Spreadsheet Functions\</link\> for a conversion table.				20200411 15:09:53
