helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153152	100			0	lv	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) specifies the number of characters for the start text. If this parameter is not defined, one character is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150260				0	lv	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149141	102			0	lv	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=LEFT("output";3)\</item\> returns “out”.				20200411 15:09:53
