helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	lv	\<variable id=\"gueltigkeit\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Validation\"\>Defines what data is valid for a selected cell or cell range.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	lv	You can also insert a list box from the Controls toolbar and link the list box to a cell. This way you can specify the valid values on the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\"\>Data\</link\> page of the list box properties window.				20200411 15:09:53
