helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159098				0	lv	Click the \<emph\>Fill Format Mode\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148609				0	lv	Click a cell to format it, or drag your mouse over a certain range to format the whole range. Repeat this action for other cells and ranges.				20200411 15:09:53
