helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10551				0	lv	Grouping pivot tables displays the \<emph\>Grouping\</emph\> dialog for either values or dates.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	lv	Start				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	lv	Specifies the start of the grouping.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056F				0	lv	Automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10573				0	lv	Specifies whether to start grouping at the smallest value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10576				0	lv	Manually at				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	lv	Specifies whether to enter the start value for grouping yourself.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	lv	End				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	lv	Specifies the end of the grouping.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10584				0	lv	Automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10588				0	lv	Specifies whether to end grouping at the largest value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058B				0	lv	Manually at				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058F				0	lv	Specifies whether to enter the end value for grouping yourself.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10592				0	lv	Group by				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10596				0	lv	Specifies the value range by which every group's limits are calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10599				0	lv	Number of days				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059D				0	lv	In the case of grouping date values, specifies the number of days to group by.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A0				0	lv	Intervals				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A4				0	lv	In the case of grouping date values, specifies the intervals to group by.				20200411 15:09:53
