helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3159184				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TTEST\"\>Returns the probability associated with a Student's t-Test.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
