helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3150424	151			0	lv	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=PERMUT(6;3)\</item\> returns 120. There are 120 different possibilities, to pick a sequence of 3 playing cards out of 6 playing cards.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143276				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>PERMUTATIONA function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
