helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_year.xhp	0	help	par_id3154304				0	lv	YEAR(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_year.xhp	0	help	par_id3156013				0	lv	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> shows the internal date value for which the year is to be returned.				20200411 15:09:53
