helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3831598				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintPreview\"\>Displays a preview of the printed page or closes the preview.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145847				0	lv	Use the icons on the \<emph\>Page Preview Bar\</emph\> to scroll through the pages of the document or to print the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id9838862				0	lv	You can also press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up and Ctrl+Page Down keys to scroll through the pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id7211828				0	lv	You cannot edit your document while you are in the page preview.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id460829				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>To exit the page preview, click the \<emph\>Close Preview\</emph\> button.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
