helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284				0	lv	Deleting Contents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	lv	\<variable id=\"inhalteloeschentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Delete\"\>Specifies the contents to be deleted from the active cell or from a selected cell range.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> If several sheets are selected, all selected sheets will be affected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	lv	This dialog is also called by pressing Del after the cell cursor has been activated on the sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145367				0	lv	Pressing Backspace deletes content without calling the dialog or changing formats.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	lv	Use \<emph\>Cut\</emph\> on the Standard bar to delete contents and formats without the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
