helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148664				0	lv	Fill Series				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	lv	\<variable id=\"reihenfuellentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillSeries\"\>Automatically generate series with the options in this dialog. Determine direction, increment, time unit and series type.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3146976				0	lv	Before filling a series, first select the cell range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	lv	To automatically continue a series using the assumed completion rules, choose the \<emph\>AutoFill\</emph\> option after opening the \<emph\>Fill Series\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
