helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729				0	lv	Determines the direction of series creation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145253				0	lv	Down				20200411 15:09:53
