helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155738				0	lv	Right				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149402				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_RIGHT\"\>Creates a series running from left to right within the selected cell range using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146972				0	lv	Up				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153711				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_TOP\"\>Creates an upward series in the cell range of the column using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
