helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147344				0	lv	Series Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257	15			0	lv	Defines the series type. Choose between \<emph\>Linear, Growth, Date \</emph\>and \<emph\>AutoFill\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
