helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155103				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>OCT2BIN function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>converting;octal numbers, into binary numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
