helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	lv	The \<emph\>Row\</emph\> or \<emph\>Column\</emph\> box must contain a reference to the first cell of the selected range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	lv	If you export a spreadsheet containing multiple operations to Microsoft Excel, the location of the cells containing the formula must be fully defined relative to the data range.				20200411 15:09:53
