helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	lv	\<variable id=\"nameneinfuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertName\"\>Inserts a defined named cell range at the current cursor's position.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	lv	You can only insert a cell area after having defined a name for the area.				20200411 15:09:53
