helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_NAMES_PASTE:LB_ENTRYLIST\"\>Lists all defined cell areas. Double-click an entry to insert the named area into the active sheet at the current cursor position.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
