helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	lv	The $[officename] Calc context menus have \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"other options\"\>additional options\</link\> for filling the cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149207				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140500.xhp\" name=\"Sheet\"\>Sheet\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155111				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140600.xhp\" name=\"Rows\"\>Series\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152994				0	lv	\<emph\>Filling cells using context menus:\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	lv	Call the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> when positioned in a cell and choose \<emph\>Selection List\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSelect\"\>A list box containing all text found in the current column is displayed.\</ahelp\> The text is sorted alphabetically and multiple entries are listed only once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	lv	Click one of the listed entries to copy it to the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Headers & Footers				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145251				0	lv	Headers & Footers				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	lv	\<variable id=\"kopfundfusszeilentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditHeaderAndFooter\"\>Allows you to define and format headers and footers.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	3			0	lv	The\<emph\> Headers/Footers \</emph\>dialog contains the tabs for defining headers and footers. There will be separate tabs for the left and right page headers and footers if the \<emph\>Same content left/right\</emph\> option was not marked in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05070000.xhp\" name=\"Page Style\"\>Page Style\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Show Sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050300.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148946				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>sheets; displaying\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>displaying; sheets\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148946				0	lv	Show Sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148799				0	lv	\<variable id=\"tabeintext\"\>\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:Show\"\>Displays sheets that were previously hidden with the \<emph\>Hide\</emph\> command.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Select one sheet only to call the command. The current sheet is always selected. If a sheet other than the current sheet is selected, you can deselect it by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> while clicking the corresponding sheet tab at the bottom of the window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151112				0	lv	Hidden sheets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:MULTILISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_SHOW_TAB:LB_ENTRYLIST\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays a list of all hidden sheets in your spreadsheet document.\</ahelp\> To show a certain sheet, click the corresponding entry on the list and confirm with OK.				20200411 15:09:53
