helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to name the different sections of your spreadsheet document.\</ahelp\> By naming the different sections, you can easily \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"navigate\"\>navigate\</link\> through the spreadsheet documents and find specific information.				20200411 15:09:53
