helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	lv	Enters text mode if a text object is selected. If there are no text objects or if you have cycled through all of the text objects on the page, a new page is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
