helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152812				0	lv	Press the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key and drag with the mouse to draw or resize an object from the center of the object outward.				20200411 15:09:53
