helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147366	59			0	lv	For example, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Callouts\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3154508\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_calloutshapes.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154508\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to open the Callouts toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FD				0	lv	Select a callout and move the mouse pointer to where you want the callout to start.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150272				0	lv	Drag to draw the callout.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id1978514				0	lv	Enter the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1091A				0	lv	Copying Text				20200411 15:09:53
