helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10925				0	lv	Copy the text to the clipboard (\<emph\>Edit - Copy\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092D				0	lv	Click the page or slide where you want to paste the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10931				0	lv	Paste the text using \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\> or \<emph\>Edit - Paste special\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093C				0	lv	Using \<emph\>Paste special\</emph\>, you can choose the text format to be pasted. Depending on formats, you can copy different text attributes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093F				0	lv	Importing Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10946				0	lv	Click the page or slide where you want to import the text.				20200411 15:09:53
