helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10952				0	lv	Select a text file (*.txt) or an HTML file and click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Insert Text\</emph\> dialog opens. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to insert the text.				20200411 15:09:53
