helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3156383				0	lv	Right-click and choose \<emph\>Modify - Connect\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257				0	lv	To create a closed object, right-click a line and choose \<emph\>Close Object\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
