helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151174				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TableModeFix\" visibility=\"visible\"\>If this mode is active, changes to a line and/or column affect only the neighboring lines or columns in question.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
