helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149822				0	lv	The settings you choose in the dialog can also be set using the mouse: Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Page Preview: Multiple Pages\</emph\> icon. Now move the mouse over the desired number of rows and columns.				20200411 15:09:53
