helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	lv	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_EDIT_FORMULA\"\>Allows you to create a formula by typing it directly into the input line or by clicking the \<emph\>Formula\</emph\> icon to display the formulas in submenu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
