helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148975				0	lv	Distribution				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153634				0	lv	Determines the number of rows and columns to print, as well as the print size. You can also choose to print several document pages on one printed page.				20200411 15:09:53
