helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155593				0	lv	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+T				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147474				0	lv	Removes cell protection from all selected tables. If no table is selected, then cell protection is removed from all of the tables in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147496				0	lv	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Del				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149504	272			0	lv	If no whole cell is selected, the text from the cursor to the end of the current sentence is deleted. If the cursor is at the end of a cell, and no whole cell is selected, the contents of the next cell are deleted. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id8539384				0	lv	If no whole cell is selected and the cursor is at the end of the table, the following sentence from below the table will be deleted and the remainder of that paragraph will be moved into the last table cell. If an empty line follows the table, the empty line will be deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id5891903				0	lv	If one or more cells are selected, the whole rows containing the selection will be deleted. If all rows are selected completely or partially, the entire table will be deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
