helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149890				0	lv	If a text frame is selected: positions the cursor to the end of the text in the text frame. If you press any key that produces a character on screen, and the document is in edit mode, the character is appended to the text.				20200411 15:09:53
