helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159260				0	lv	\<variable id=\"text_nav_keyb\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_nav_keyb.xhp\" name=\"Navigating and Selecting With the Keyboard\"\>Navigating and Selecting With the Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
