helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	lv	Click in the paragraph where you want to add the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154872	35			0	lv	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	6			0	lv	Click "Hidden Paragraph" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155947				0	lv	Enter a statement in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149991				0	lv	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3793450				0	lv	You must enable this feature by removing the check mark from menu \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>. When the check mark is set, you cannot hide any paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148675				0	lv	To Hide a Section				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148697				0	lv	Select the text that you want to hide in your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153019				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148950				0	lv	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\>, and then enter an expression in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
