helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149688				0	lv	\<variable id=\"template_create\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/template_create.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Document Template\"\>Creating a Document Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149492				0	lv	You can create a template to use as the basis for creating new text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	lv	Create a document and add the content and formatting styles that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	lv	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Template\</item\> box, type a name for the new template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	lv	Select a template category in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	lv	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	lv	To create a document based on the template, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - New - Templates and Documents\</item\>, select the template, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Open\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
