helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148856				0	lv	\<variable id=\"hidden_text_display\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text_display.xhp\" name=\"Displaying Hidden Text\"\>Displaying Hidden Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id5659962				0	lv	If you have a text that was hidden by defining a condition with a variable, you have several options to display the hidden text. Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3152777				0	lv	Enable the check mark at \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902				0	lv	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114				0	lv	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id1865901				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text.xhp\" name=\"Hiding Text\"\>Hiding Text\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
