helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145080				0	lv	You can only animate text that is contained in a drawing object, such as rectangles, lines, or text objects. For example, draw a rectangle, then double-click the rectangle and enter your text.				20200411 15:09:53
