helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819				0	lv	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Effect\</item\> box, select the animation that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	lv	Set the properties of the effect, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
