helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149590				0	lv	Drag in your document to draw the text object, and then type your text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154415	71			0	lv	Click outside of the object, then click the text you entered. Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/05090000.xhp\" name=\"Object Rotation Mode\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Rotate\</item\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3145405\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145405\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drawing Object Properties\</item\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
