helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	lv	Type a number in the \<emph\>Value\</emph\> box, or leave the box empty to use automatic numbering.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3154851	58			0	lv	Select the outline level where you want the numbering to restart in the \<emph\>Level \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
