helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	hd_id4792321				0	lv	To Wrap Text Around an Object				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3149696				0	lv	Select the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3155907				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>Format - Wrap\</emph\>, and then choose the wrapping style that you want to apply.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	lv	The current wrapping style is indicated by a bullet.				20200411 15:09:53
