helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Insert\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155870				0	lv	Press F6 until the focus is on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
