helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149846				0	lv	$[officename] uses page styles to specify the layout of a page, including the page orientation, background, margins, headers, footers, and text columns. To change the layout of an individual page in a document, you must create and apply a custom page style to the page.				20200411 15:09:53
