helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149346				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds;text objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>words;backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text;backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds;selecting\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
