helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150110				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_PROTECT\"\>Prevents the selected section from being edited.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
