helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149555				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_INSERT_SECTION_CB_PASSWD\"\>Protects the selected section with a password. The password must have a minimum of 5 characters.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150549				0	lv	...				20200411 15:09:53
