helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147170				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_SORTING:CB_KEY3\"\>Specifies additional sorting criteria. You can also combine sort keys.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
