helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150254				0	lv	Key type 1 to 3				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149752				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_SORTING:DLB_KEY3\"\>Select the sorting option that you want to use.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
