helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145415	4			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:MULTILINEEDIT:TP_ENV_ENV:EDT_ADDR\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the delivery address.\</ahelp\> You can also click in this box, and select a database, a table, and field, and then click the arrow button to insert the field in the address. If you want, you can apply  formatting, such as bold and underline, to the address text.				20200411 15:09:53
