helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150251				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowHiddenParagraphs\"\>Shows or hides hidden paragraphs.\</ahelp\> This option only affects the screen display of hidden paragraphs, and not the printing of hidden paragraphs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157875				0	lv	To enable this feature, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and ensure that the \<emph\>Hidden paragraphs\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Display of\</emph\> area is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	lv	Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"field command\"\>field command\</link\> "Hidden Paragraph" to assign a \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\> that must be met to hide a paragraph. If the condition is not met, the paragraph is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	lv	When you hide a paragraph, footnotes and frames that are anchored to characters in the paragraph are also hidden.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Assign Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155621				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120219.xhp\" name=\"Assign Styles\"\>Assign Styles\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3145828				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADD_IDX_STYLES\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Creates index entries from specific paragraph styles.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145249				0	lv	Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3150566				0	lv	The list contains the paragraph styles that you can assign to index levels.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3147176	5			0	lv	To create an index entry from a paragraph style, click the style in the\<emph\> Styles\</emph\> list, and then click the \<emph\>>> \</emph\>button to move the style to the index level that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150762				0	lv	<<				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3149289				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_ADD_IDX_STYLES_PB_LEFT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves the selected paragraph style up one level in the index hierarchy.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151178				0	lv	>>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3157903				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_ADD_IDX_STYLES_PB_RIGHT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves the selected paragraph style down one level in the index hierarchy.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Insert Section				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154108				0	lv	\<variable id=\"bereicheinfuegen\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Section\"\>Insert Section\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480				0	lv	\<variable id=\"bereich\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"FN_INSERT_COLUMN_SECTION\"\>Inserts a text section at the cursor position in the document. You can also select a block of text and then choose this command to create a section. You can use sections to insert blocks of text from other documents, to apply custom column layouts, or to protect or to hide blocks of text if a condition is met.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152955				0	lv	You can insert an entire document in a section, or a named section from another. You can also insert a section as a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#dde\" name=\"DDE\"\>DDE\</link\> link.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149684				0	lv	To edit a section, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02170000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sections\"\>\<emph\>Format - Sections\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155183	6			0	lv	The \<emph\>Insert Section \</emph\>dialog contains the following tabs:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151257				0	lv	Insert				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149102				0	lv	Inserts the section that you defined at the current cursor position in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Hyphenation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154657				0	lv	Hyphenation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148572				0	lv	\<variable id=\"silben\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts hyphens in words that are too long to fit at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> $[officename] searches the document and suggests hyphenation that you can accept or reject. If text is selected, the Hyphenation dialog works on the selected text only. If no text is selected, the Hyphenation dialog works on the whole document.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	lv	To automatically hyphenate the current or selected paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>Text Flow\</link\> tab. You can also apply automatic hyphenation to a paragraph style. In text where automatic hyphenation is enabled, the Hyphenation dialog will not find any word to hyphenate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151389				0	lv	When $[officename] finds a word that requires hyphenation, do one of the following options:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155622				0	lv	To accept the hyphenation of the displayed word, click \<emph\>Hyphenate\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558				0	lv	To change the hyphenation of the displayed word, click the left or right arrow below the word, and then click \<emph\>Hyphenate\</emph\>. The left and right buttons are enabled for words with multiple hyphenation points.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150017				0	lv	To reject the hyphenation of the displayed word, click \<emph\>Skip\</emph\>. This word will not be hyphenated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150018				0	lv	To automatically hyphenate the remaining part of the selection or the document, click \<emph\>Hyphenate All\</emph\> and answer "Yes" to the following question.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150019				0	lv	To end hyphenation, click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>. The hyphenation that is applied already will not be reverted. You can use \<emph\>Edit - Undo\</emph\> to undo all hyphenation that was applied while the Hyphenation dialog was open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147562				0	lv	To exclude paragraphs from the automatic hyphenation, select the paragraphs, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, click the Text Flow tab, and then clear the \<emph\>Automatically\</emph\> check box in the Hyphenation area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154276				0	lv	To disable the Hyphenation dialog and always hyphenate automatically, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010400.xhp\" name=\"Language Settings - Writing Aids\"\>Language Settings - Writing Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and select the \<emph\>Hyphenate without inquiry\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152950				0	lv	To manually enter a hyphen directly in the document, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Minus sign (-).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147523				0	lv	To insert a non-breaking (protected) hyphen directly in the document, click in the word that you want to hyphenate, and then press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>+Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Minus sign(-).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154573				0	lv	To hide custom hyphens, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and then clear the \<emph\>Custom hyphens\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150360				0	lv	Word				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153676				0	lv	Word				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149687				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:ED_WORD\"\>Displays the hyphenation suggestion(s) for the selected word.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154195				0	lv	Left / Right Arrow				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155174				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_RIGHT\"\>Set the position of the hyphen. This option is only available if more than one hyphenation suggestion is displayed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151327				0	lv	Next				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149306				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_HYPH_CONTINUE\"\>Ignores the hyphenation suggestion and finds the next word to hyphenate.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149495				0	lv	Hyphenate				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPHENATE\"\>Inserts the hyphen at the indicated position.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154829				0	lv	Remove				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_HYPH_DELETE\"\>Removes the current hyphenation point from the displayed word.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Fields				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083281				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06200000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>Fields\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UpdateFields\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Updates the contents of all fields in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06170000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	All Indexes and Tables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149875				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06170000.xhp\" name=\"All Indexes and Tables\"\>All Indexes and Tables\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150211				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UpdateAllIndexes\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Update all indexes and tables of contents in the current document. You do not need to place the cursor in an index or table before you use this command.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Indents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155898				0	lv	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020200.xhp\" name=\"Indents\"\>Indents\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
