helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151251				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_MULTMRK:LB_TOX\"\>Displays the type of index that the selected entry belongs to.\</ahelp\> You cannot change the index type of an index entry in this dialog. Instead, you must delete the index entry from the document, and then insert it again in a different index type.				20200411 15:09:53
