helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145829				0	lv	\<variable id=\"texttab\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertTableText\"\>Converts the selected text into a table, or the selected table into text.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015				0	lv	The options available in this dialog depending on the type of conversion.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145247				0	lv	Separate text at				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148388				0	lv	A separator, such as a tab, marks the column boundaries in the selected text. Each paragraph in the selection is converted into a row in the table. Similarly, when you convert a table into text, the column markers are changed to the character that you specify, and each row is converted into a separate paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
