helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148386				0	lv	Evenly distribute contents to all columns				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149024				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distributes the text in multi-column sections. The text flows into all columns to the same height. The height of the section adjusts automatically.\</ahelp\>Evenly distributes the text in \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020000.xhp\" name=\"multi-column sections\"\>multi-column sections\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
