helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05190000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083450				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SplitTable\"\>Splits the current table into two separate tables at the cursor position.\</ahelp\> You can also access this command by right-clicking in a table cell.				20200411 15:09:53
