helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156379				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TEMPLDLG_WATERCAN\"\>Applies the selected style to the object or text that you select in the document. Click this icon, and then drag a selection in the document to apply the style.\</ahelp\> To exit this mode, click the icon again, or press Esc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114				0	lv	\<image id=\"img_id3150122\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_stylenewbyexample.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150122\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
