helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN109DA				0	lv	New style from selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149552				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a new style based on the formatting of the current paragraph, page, or selection.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
