helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	bm_id9646290				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>resizing;aspect ratio\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>aspect ratio;resizing objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
