helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150568				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FRM_STD\"\>Specifies the size and the position of the selected object or frame on a page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147168				0	lv	Size				20200411 15:09:53
