helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145799				0	lv	\<bookmark_value\>databases; exchanging\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>address books; exchanging\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exchanging databases\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>replacing;databases\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145799				0	lv	Exchange Database				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	2			0	lv	\<variable id=\"datenbankaustext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChangeDatabaseField\"\>Change the data sources for the current document.\</ahelp\> To correctly display the contents of inserted fields, the replacement database must contain identical field names. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	lv	For example, if you inserting address fields in a form letter from an address database, you can then exchange the database with another address database to insert different addresses.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149130				0	lv	Exchanging Databases				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	lv	You can only change one database at a time in this dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146965				0	lv	Databases in Use				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149053				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are currently in use.\</ahelp\> The current document contains at least one data field from each of the databases in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147300				0	lv	Available Databases				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150533				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are registered in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DB				0	lv	Browse				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DF				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"1419596301\"\>Opens a file open dialog to select a database file (*.odb). The selected file is added to the Available Databases list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149349				0	lv	Define				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145827	11			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Replaces the current data source with the data source that you selected in the \<emph\>Available Databases \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	lv	To exchange a database:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149881				0	lv	Ensure that both databases contain matching field names and field types.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	lv	Click in the document that you want to change the data source for.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	lv	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Exchange Database\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
