helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_matfie.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053D				0	lv	Matches the logical field names of the layout dialog to the field names in your database when you create new \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge03.xhp\"\>address blocks\</link\> or \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge04.xhp\"\>salutations\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
