helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05110500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149050				0	lv	\<variable id=\"loeschentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteRows\"\>Deletes the selected row(s) from the table.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Frame				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151189				0	lv	Frame				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	lv	\<variable id=\"rahm\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFrame\"\>Inserts a frame that you can use to create a layout of one or more columns of text and objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	lv	To edit a frame, click the border to select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Frame/Object\</emph\>. You can also resize or move a selected frame using special \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04130100.xhp\" name=\"shortcut keys\"\>shortcut keys\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	lv	To delete a frame, click the border of the frame, and then press Delete.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151311				0	lv	If you see small red arrows at the beginning and the end of text in frame, use the arrow keys to scroll through the remaining text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	lv	In the preview area of the \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> dialog, the frame is represented by a green rectangle, and the reference area by a red rectangle.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149694				0	lv	You can also preview the effects when you change the frame anchor to "As Character". The "Baseline" is drawn in red, "Character" is the font height, and "line" is the height of the line, including the frame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149107				0	lv	Icon on the Insert toolbar:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148970				0	lv	\<variable id=\"syrahmentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFrameInteract\"\>Draws a frame where you drag in the document. Click the arrow next to the icon to select the number of columns for the frame.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lv	Name and Path of HTML Documents				20200411 15:09:53
