helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147569				0	lv	Structure and formatting				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	7			0	lv	The \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line defines how the entries in the index are composed. To change the appearance of an entry you can enter codes or text in the empty boxes on this line. You can also click in an empty box or on a code, and then click a code button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292	35			0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the remainder of the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	8			0	lv	To delete a code from the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click the code, and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Delete\</item\> key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	9			0	lv	To replace a code from the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click the code, and then click a code button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480	10			0	lv	To add a code to the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click in an empty box, and then click a code button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153675				0	lv	Chapter number (E#)				20200411 15:09:53
