helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151335				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_CONDCOLL:PB_REMOVE\"\>Click here to remove the current context assigned to the selected style.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
