helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154829				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_CONDCOLL:PB_ASSIGN\"\>Click \<emph\>Assign\</emph\> to apply the \<emph\>selected Paragraph Style\</emph\> to the defined \<emph\>context\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
