helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10553				0	lv	Specify the recipients for the mail merge document as well as the layout of the address block.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10561				0	lv	The Mail Merge wizard opens to this page if you start the wizard in a text document that already contains address database fields. If the wizard opens directly to this page, the \<emph\>Select address list\</emph\> button is called \<emph\>Select different address list\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10556				0	lv	The title of this page is \<emph\>Address block\</emph\> for letters and \<emph\>Address list\</emph\> for e-mail messages.				20200411 15:09:53
