helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151184				0	lv	\<variable id=\"feldbefehltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FieldDialog\"\>Opens a dialog where you can edit the properties of a field. Click in front of a field, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\> In the dialog, you can use the arrow buttons to move to the previous or the next field.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151168				0	lv	You can also double-click a field in your document to open the field for editing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153668				0	lv	To change the view between field names and field contents in your document, choose \<emph\>View - Fields\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149106	59			0	lv	If you select a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#dde\" name=\"DDE\"\>DDE\</link\> link in your document, and then choose \<emph\>Edit - Fields, \</emph\>the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02180000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Links\"\>\<emph\>Edit Links\</emph\>\</link\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149036				0	lv	If you click in front of a "sender" type field, and then choose \<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>, the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"User data\"\>\<emph\>User data\</emph\>\</link\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145765				0	lv	Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155142				0	lv	Lists the type of field that you are editing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151371				0	lv	The following dialog elements are only visible when the corresponding field type is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150687				0	lv	Select				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150700				0	lv	Lists the field options, for example, "fixed". If you want, you can click another option for the selected field type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155854				0	lv	Format				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147409				0	lv	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKNUMFORMAT\"\>Select the format for the contents of the field. For date, time, and user-defined fields, you can also click "Additional formats" in the list, and then choose a different format.\</ahelp\> The formats that are available depend on the type of field that you are editing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149556				0	lv	Offset				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256				0	lv	Displays the offset for the selected field type, for example, for "Next Page," "Page Numbers" or "Previous Page". You can enter a new offset value which will be added to the displayed page number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id5081637				0	lv	If you want to change the actual page number and not the displayed number, do not use the \<emph\>Offset\</emph\> value. To change page numbers, read the \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagenumbers.xhp\" name=\"Page Numbers\"\>\<emph\>Page Numbers\</emph\>\</link\> guide.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145269				0	lv	Level				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150559				0	lv	Change the defined values and outline levels for the "Chapter" field type.				20200411 15:09:53
