helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149834				0	lv	Displays the name of a field variable. If you want, you can enter a new name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148844				0	lv	Value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148857				0	lv	Displays the current value of the field variable. If you want, you can enter a new value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153306				0	lv	Condition				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156124				0	lv	Displays the condition that must be met for the field to be activated. If you want, you can enter a new \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156103				0	lv	Then, Else				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155073				0	lv	Change the field contents that are displayed depending on whether the field condition is met or not.				20200411 15:09:53
