helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	lv	Displays the name of the macro assigned to the selected field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150097				0	lv	Placeholder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150027				0	lv	Displays the placeholder text of the selected field.				20200411 15:09:53
